       "description": "Vaultio puts contractors at the top of Google SEO and AI search engines — and keeps them there. While competitors fight for scraps, your business becomes the first name customers see on Google, ChatGPT, and AI-powered search the moment they're ready to buy.\n\nWe don't just get you found — we turn visibility into booked jobs. Vaultio combines #1 search rankings with lightning-fast lead response, engaging every new inquiry within seconds so you capture the customers others lose. The result: a steady, predictable flow of 10–15 extra jobs every month, more market share, and a brand that dominates your local area.\n\nNo guesswork. No wasted ad spend. Just measurable growth, backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you're a home service contractor ready to own your market and leave competitors behind, Vaultio is how you get there.\nRank #1. Capture every lead. Dominate your market.",
