        "word_choice_and_vocabulary": "Uses industry-specific terminology (e.g., SEO, CPL, Meta Ads, Local Service Ads) alongside accessible language to ensure comprehension by contractors. Vocabulary emphasizes results, efficiency, and trust (e.g., 'qualified leads,' 'optimization,' 'guarantee,' 'performance').",
